WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
Kirika-senpai's Confession

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:38.800
He's injured. I have to help him.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:42.930
Huh? Boing?

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:49.020
Senpai has breasts!

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:53.900
Which means that Kirika-senpai is a…

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:56.200
WOMAN!

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:58.490
Karin!

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:02.450
K-Kazune-kun! W-What's wrong?

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:05.040
Are you okay?

00:02:05.410 --> 00:02:07.540
Yes, I'm fine.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.460
That pillar of light just now…

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.170
Is he hurt?

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:18.380
D-Don't touch senpai!

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:21.970
Ah, no, I mean…

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:24.060
His injuries might be severe.

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:26.390
Understand?

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:29.400
I understand, I'll bring him to a hospital right away.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:31.900
Huh? Hospital?

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:35.650
Doctor, please help me!

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:36.690
Okay!

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:37.900
Let's see…

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:43.370
He's a woman!

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.330
No!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.250
Why?

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:52.840
I can hear senpai's voice from his heart.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:56.760
"I just hate hospitals."

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:04.010
A-Anyway, just leave Kirika-senpai to me!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.520
What's with her?

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:24.370
The ring's reaction grows stronger here.

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.160
Why is that?

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.870
Kazune-kun.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.170
Nishikiyori.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:32.880
Why are you…

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.880
Kazune-kun, look at this!

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:40.930
My ring's shining, even though it's done nothing for so long.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.720
You know something about this, right?

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:52.310
It's probably… an effect from Kirika's strange ring.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.150
Strange ring?

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:56.480
What is this?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.120
Kazune-kun.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.040
Thank you, Kyuu-chan.

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:16.920
Karin-chan, what happened?

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.550
I don't really know either.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.930
There was a large pillar of light.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:25.550
When I came to, senpai had collapsed.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.100
Senpai!

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.560
You've woken up, right?

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:33.350
I'm glad.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.770
Where is this?

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.160
Were you surprised?

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.790
Or did you find out before?

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:56.920
That I'm a woman.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:03.760
I was really shocked, seen I hadn't noticed at all.

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:08.100
I never had the slightest idea that you were a woman.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.470
I guess it's impossible after all.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:15.810
For a woman to live as a man.

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:17.860
Senpai…

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.990
I lost my parents when I was young.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:34.250
My brother was the only family I had left.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:42.630
I also don't know my parents from anything other that photos.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:49.140
My brother and I were taken into the Karasuma family, and we got a new sister.

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.140
We thought a happy life was in store for us.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:54.520
But…

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:02.690
Because I knew about the ring, everything changed.

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.610
Eh, the ring?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.910
The god transformation rings.

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:12.830
Our father, as a scholar, researched them with professor Kujyou.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:20.340
I've stood before you in my transformed form numerous times.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.250
Together with my brother.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:28.720
That mysterious goddess was Kirika-senpai…

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:36.850
My brother placed more value in the ring's power than his life.

00:06:38.390 --> 00:06:42.320
He wanted to return to how he was before his parents died.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.990
But I was afraid of that.

00:06:49.280 --> 00:06:51.700
It felt as if I was being left behind by my only brother.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:57.580
It felt like the ring was changing my brother into a different person.

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:04.090
So I pretended to be a boy, as I thought I'd be able to follow my brother.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:09.090
But it was impossible after all.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.640
I sure was foolish.

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:14.810
But…

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.140
But I…

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:22.110
I loved that senpai!

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.110
I was surprised to find out that you're a girl.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:31.530
And hearing all this was weird, but…

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:35.030
I… I…

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.840
I loved you too.

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:52.840
You are, unlike me, able to argue with boys without hesitation, as a girl.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.850
I always admired you.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:57.850
As a girl.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:02.310
Thanks.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.860
You're the most wonderful girl in the world.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.230
Senpai.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:15.330
Senpai's chest felt really warm, and gentle.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.000
The person I always admired…

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:24.630
…I really… loved you.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.420
Farewell, senpai.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:32.180
Farewell.

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:26.020
Karin-chan!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:29.190
Kazune-kun's in trouble!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:32.400
Kazune-kun.

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:35.280
He collapsed in the park.

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.620
A friend of his carried him over here.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.120
He hasn't opened his eyes at all.

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:46.000
It's because he transformed to try and stop Kirika-senpai.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:55.970
I have the feeling that Kazune-chan sleeps longer at night recently.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:04.600
He used to never collapse even when he had become a god.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:08.690
I'm very worried.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:11.480
I'm sure he's fine, Himeka-chan.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:14.150
It's Kazune-kun we're talking about. I'm sure he's fine.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:21.120
But it will become dangerous if he keeps on transforming as often as he has been lately.

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.870
"Dangerous"? You mean like his eyes not opening?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:27.870
No. Something worse…

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:32.210
Kyuu-chan, tell me…

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.840
What is going to happen to Kazune-chan?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:43.010
If this continues, there's a chance he might die.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.020
Kazune-kun's life is in danger.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.520
That's…

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:52.730
No!

00:10:53.610 --> 00:10:57.280
If Kazune-chan is almost dying…

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:02.240
he should just stop transforming!

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:05.290
But, if he doesn't, then you'll…

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:11.830
That's better than Kazune-chan dying!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:17.510
Kazune-chan has been with me since childhood.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:23.100
He's my very, very important… family.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:25.810
Himeka-chan.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:34.900
I'm sorry, Karin-chan.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.650
I suddenly started crying.

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:42.490
It's okay. I know what you have to go through.

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.870
Even if I think would happen if Kazune-kun wasn't here anymore…

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:54.630
Kazune-kun is your only precious family member, right?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:12:01.050
My parents died when I was young.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.560
I only know them from a photograph.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.390
A photograph?

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:08.600
Yeah.

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:13.900
It's my treasure, so I hide it.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:19.570
Wait a minute, I'll let you see it.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:21.490
Hanazono-san.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:23.990
Micchi, why are you here?

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.200
I'm the one who carried Kazune-kun here.

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.750
How's Kazune-kun doing?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.170
He's still asleep.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:34.210
I see.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.340
There is something I want to ask him when he wakes up.

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:40.760
Karin-chan.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.840
Look, this is it.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:57.860
I found this one photograph when I was snooping around Kyuu-chan's room.

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.820
Karin-chan, what's wrong?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:12.330
Could this photograph be the same as the one from my parents?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:16.080
That's can't be!

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:18.000
Hanazono-san, what are you looking at?

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:21.710
Isn't this professor Kujyou?

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:24.760
This photo must have been from when he was very young.

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:26.720
This brings me back.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:29.760
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:33.300
I am God!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.260
You moron.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.260
It's a croquette!

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:41.030
Isn't this professor Kujyou?

00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:44.280
This photo must have been from when he was very young.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.110
This brings me back.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:51.950
That should be a photograph of Himeka-chan's parents.

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:57.000
When you say "professor Kujyou", you're talking about Kazune-kun's father, right?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:09.390
Since Kazune-chan and I are cousins, doesn't it make sense for our parents to look alike?

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.020
Well then, I'm going home.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:13.560
Give my regards to Kazune-kun.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.600
Wait a minute, Micchi!

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:30.530
Micchi, wait up!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.240
What is it?

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:38.000
That photograph was supposed to be of Himeka-chan's parents.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.420
Eh, is that so?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.930
But I have that photograph too.

00:14:46.930 --> 00:14:48.890
It's the same as the photograph or my parents.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:56.310
And after you saw the photograph, you said it was professor Kujyou!

00:14:56.810 --> 00:15:00.060
Professor Kujyou is Kazune-kun's father, right?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:06.440
You wouldn't mistake professor Kujyou, would you?

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.160
I wonder…

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:10.660
Micchi, wait!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.080
Please, tell me if you know anything!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.670
Why do we have the same photogr-

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:31.930
Later.

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:33.050
See you tomorrow.

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:42.230
What was that?!

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:51.360
I couldn't sleep at all.

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.200
That guy…

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:55.830
What does he think the lips of a maiden are?!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.410
That photograph bothers me as well…

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.580
Kazune-kun.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.050
Good morning, Karin.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.380
Good morning.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.140
I'm glad you're up.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:17.270
Yeah. Did I collapse in the park?

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:19.430
Apparently.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.730
They say Micchi carried you here.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.400
I see.

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:29.740
I'm sure… just before that Kirika's ring went out of control…

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.070
Ring?

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.450
You know, that strange ring he gave you.

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:40.040
The power of the ring must've been too great for Kirika to control.

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:46.960
Kirika-senpai's sleeping in my room right now.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:53.470
I heard from senpai yesterday.

00:16:56.550 --> 00:17:00.100
She said she's that goddess.

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.440
I see.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:11.990
Are you okay?

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.110
Cheer up.

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:18.120
G-Geez, what are you talking about?!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.040
You're the one who has to cheer up!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.160
I mean, you collapsed!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:24.670
You're right.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.630
Don't make me worry too much.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.710
If you keep transforming like this then…

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:37.180
If this continues, there's a chance he might die.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.270
Don't give me that look.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.060
I know.

00:17:48.310 --> 00:17:51.070
I'm in trouble if I keep on transforming, right?

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:57.870
Don't worry, you won't be the same as me.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:17:59.160
Why?

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:03.980
Glasses guy and I are fine, so why are you…

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.920
It's because my body's incomplete.

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:12.260
I've been tampered even before I was born.

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.590
So I could transform to be a stronger god than before.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.140
T-That…

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:20.970
isn't possible?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.640
I don't really understand.

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.680
But my father was a professor.

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.100
That's…

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:28.690
But it seems I wasn't perfect.

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:32.610
Because of that I get worn out really quickly, it's annoying.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.870
You moron, don't be so gloomy.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.950
W-What was that?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:43.700
It'll be fine.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.410
I won't die.

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.000
So, don't worry about such stupid things, little silly.

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.460
But…

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:53.090
It's okay.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.680
I said I'm okay, so don't give me that look.

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:01.800
Ah, geez.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.770
If you stay like that, my mood won't get better either.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:07.640
Okay?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.020
Yes.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.020
Good!

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.570
It's strange.

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.360
I feel more courageous when I'm with Kazune-kun.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.110
Kazune-kun is strong.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:27.250
There may still be secrets hidden in things like that photograph, but…

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.790
we'll figure them out if we believe we can.

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:38.800
Ah, did you wake up?

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:40.590
When did you get here?

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.850
Everyone went to school.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:46.600
This is Kujyou-kun's house, right?

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.140
Why…

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:52.060
It seems the fog in your heart has cleared.

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.280
Please rest well.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.440
Good morning!

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:40.150
There are a lot of things I want to ask Micchi, but…

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:42.910
I can't!!!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:46.030
I can't face him!

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:51.660
How's your body holding up, Kazune-chan?

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.960
It's fine.

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:55.590
Everyone's just worrying too much.

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.380
Even if I can't transform, I'll figure something out.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.010
You know I don't really like transforming in the first place, right?

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:04.720
So this is perfect.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:12.810
Isn't it painful for you?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.940
Why should it be painful for me?

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.070
I know!

00:21:20.110 --> 00:21:25.070
You might not like transforming, but…

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:33.370
in your heart, you know that it's supporting you.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:43.130
Kazune-chan… I can see through you… it's obvious.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:51.180
I always notice when you lie… because of your habit.

00:21:57.810 --> 00:21:59.730
I'm sorry. I…

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:03.070
need to do something, quick.

00:22:03.070 --> 00:22:04.360
Or I won't last.

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:06.780
Kazune-chan.

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:11.790
Kazune-kun's habit.

00:22:12.950 --> 00:22:15.670
I'm sorry, Himeka.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.870
The Rival is Prince Kazune

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:07.560
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:10.450
The Rival is Prince Kazune!

00:24:10.450 --> 00:24:12.910
It's a battle with Kazune-kun at the drama contest!

00:24:13.120 --> 00:24:16.290
My role is the "Princess Poisoned Apple"?

00:24:16.450 --> 00:24:19.410
Eel is delicious-nya!, nya-nya-nya!
